# The accounts database's sa password (F61.1): copy to config/.env.sql (git-ignored). Only puls-sql reads this file,
# so the database container never sees the keys in config/.env.secrets. SQL Server wants at least eight characters
# with upper case, lower case, a digit and a symbol. ACCOUNTS_SQL_URL in config/.env.secrets carries the same password.
MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD=Pick-a-long-random-value-1
